<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Western National.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Western National.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it upgraded Western National Corp to market outperformer from market performer.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Western National gained 3/8 to 22-1/8 in morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
